WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,680
They were the two captains of our base

2
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,380
I'm dead

3
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:12,510
but i can control them

4
00:00:13,010 --> 00:00:14,910
I am Wang Ling, the Necromancer

5
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:17,310
He can actually turn a stuntman who died in battle into a puppet.

6
00:00:17,610 --> 00:00:19,100
Afraid of paying a high price

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,700
As long as it continues to turn into fighting power

8
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,900
No one will die from now on

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,700
I am Li Jingru, the person in charge of Jianghua’s medical base.

10
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:26,200
Rooms have been prepared for you

11
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:27,500
Please come with me

12
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,500
After the break we can discuss the battle plan

13
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:31,790
There are no plans to discuss

14
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,690
The plan is to listen to us

15
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:36,410
Xiaoting is impatient

16
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:37,910
Don't take it to heart

17
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:39,510
Of course she is also very strong

18
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:42,510
We'll find out about the situation later, don't worry
